## ***********************************************************************
## **  GFE.TEXT.INC.BL -- every string GUI-FIELD-EDIT shows, in GFE.TEXTBANK.
## **
## **  Include it after the regions and above GFE.LIBEND, so the GOTO at
## **  the top steps over it. GFE.TEXTBANK is #DEFINEd in the program and
## **  claimed in GFE.CLAIM.BANKS.
## ***********************************************************************

